WEBVTT

00:03:59.678 --> 00:04:02.818
that it’s 1,000 times
stronger than morphine.

00:04:03.198 --> 00:04:05.298
And you’re probably asking yourself:

00:04:05.318 --> 00:04:07.838
Why would a sea snail produce something

00:04:07.858 --> 00:04:10.598
that’s 1,000 times
stronger than morphine?

00:04:11.058 --> 00:04:12.758
Is that why they're slow?

00:04:12.778 --> 00:04:13.938
(Laughter)

00:04:14.838 --> 00:04:16.118
And the answer?

00:04:16.158 --> 00:04:17.918
Ingenious evolution.

00:04:18.558 --> 00:04:20.738
See, these sea snails hunt fish,

00:04:20.758 --> 00:04:23.298
and they don't have the speed
to chase down their prey

00:04:23.338 --> 00:04:25.058
like a lion hunts a gazelle.

00:04:25.358 --> 00:04:28.218
So instead, they harpoon their prey

00:04:28.238 --> 00:04:31.558
injecting it with a potent
mixture of neurotoxins